{"study_accession":"PRJNA289959","secondary_study_accession":"SRP061184","title":"Direct in vivo evidence for B-cell receptor and NF-KB activation in mantle cell lymphoma: role of the lymph node microenvironment and activating mutations. [RNA-Seq]","description":"We provide direct in vivo evidence for activation of the BCR and canonical NF-KB pathways in MCL that, in the absence of activating mutations, is dependent on the lymph node microenvironment. This finding provides a mechanistic explanation for the surprising efficacy of ibrutinib for the treatment of this type of lymphoma. Mutations in components of the BCR and NF-KB pathways are associated with cell-autonomous signaling and resistance to ibrutinib. Overall design: Lymph node biopsies and peripheral blood samples were obtained from patients with previously untreated MCL.","pubmed":"27127301;37373427","geo_series":"","n_samples":15,"study_labels":[{"level":"study","event_code":"MINOR_PROCEDURE","certainty":"confirmed","delta_days":0.0,"delta_bucket":"D0","time_precision":"day","stage":"teacher","confidence":1.0,"evidence":"Overall design: Lymph node biopsies and peripheral blood samples were obtained from patients with previously untreated MCL.","model_version":"teacher:mlx:mlx-community/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct-4bit"}],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN03860156","study_accession":"PRJNA289959","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Mantle cell lymphoma [2721]","description":"Mantle cell lymphoma [2721]","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM1821967","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2016-07-16","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood"],["cell_type","CD19+ selected B cells"],["disease","Mantle cell lymphoma"],["tissue","peripheral blood"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR2103041","experiment_accession":"SRX1097621","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":26789272,"base_count":2678927200,"first_public":"2016-07-16